            "review_title": "Review at Mangkorn",
            "review_text": "iqbal_ahsan\nKanpur, India240 contributions\n0\nA must for Thai food lovers\nOct 2025 • Couples\nIf you really want to have authentic Thai food , you must visit thisrestaurant In Lotte mall\nTried fishballs , green curry \nPad Thai shrimp \nAlong with Honey chia \nI must say that all these were of excellent quality and reasonably priced. In fact, all these were having good quantity,and were sufficient for more than 2 persons\nRead more\nWritten October 28, 2025",
